From: Oichkatzelesfrettschen <151315375+Oichkatzelesfrettschen@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] devices: remove Rival 710 from rival700 profile

The Rival 710 (1038:1730) is being moved to its own profile,
``devices/rival710.py``, so that 710-specific work can land independently
of the Rival 700.

This change does not affect the Rival 700 (1038:1700) in any way.

--- a/rivalcfg/devices/rival700.py
+++ b/rivalcfg/devices/rival700.py
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@
 )

 profile = {
-    "name": "SteelSeries Rival 700 / SteelSeries Rival 710",
+    "name": "SteelSeries Rival 700",
     "models": [
         {
             "name": "SteelSeries Rival 700",
@@ -21,12 +21,6 @@
             "product_id": 0x1700,
             "endpoint": 0,
         },
-        {
-            "name": "SteelSeries Rival 710",
-            "vendor_id": 0x1038,
-            "product_id": 0x1730,
-            "endpoint": 0,
-        },
     ],
     "settings": {
         "sensitivity1": {
